// Creatures

// Nydra'Nath, the Half Black Dragon Spirit
@1 = ~Nydra'Nath~
@2 = ~Ancestral Greatsword~
@3 = ~Ancestral Greatsword

The two-handed sword of a half black dragon ancestor, as ghostly as its bearer. Its blade drips with acid.

Each hit has a 10% chance of each of the following, never both at a time:
- Swamp plants: the target is held fast (movement stopped, -2 AC) for 1 round, save vs. Spell negates.
- Insect swarm: the target cannot cast spells and is bitten for 3 rounds.

STATISTICS:

THAC0: +3
Damage: 1d10 +3 (slashing) + 2d6 acid
Speed Factor: 7
Proficiency Type: Two-Handed Sword
Type: Two-handed~
@4 = ~Ancestral Breath~
@5 = ~Ancestral Breath

Nydra'Nath breathes a line of acid: 10d8 acid damage, save vs. Breath for half. Once per summoning.~
@6 = ~Wing Buffet~
@7 = ~Rage~
@8 = ~Swamp Plants~
@9 = ~Insect Swarm~
